    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9706" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">com-pugno</span></b> , āre, v. n.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To fight</i> or <i>contend
			together</i> (post-class.), <i><span class="en">Gell. 12,
				5, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 5,
			4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">14, 5</span></i>
			<i>fin.</i>; <i><span class="en">Sulp. Sev. de Vita
				S. Mart. 14</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To combat together</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">amaritudinem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Art. Vet. 1, 13, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
